{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73e69ec896a12698f321078c00de209e17031df83a5ddfb24625d9f458aa274a", "ja": "（今日はこれから、定期公演の打ち合わせだ。\n公演では、歩の新曲を披露する事になるんだけど……）", "zh": "（今天接下来要开定期公演的筹备会。\n公演上要表演步的新歌，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "91a3c0a6bac7add9fe87397b8e89aea2801240c11035d730f76bf9007728b547", "ja": "あっ、兄ちゃんはっけーん！\n朋花様、あそこに兄ちゃんがいますぜ！", "zh": "啊，发现哥哥了！\n朋花大人，哥哥在那里哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "d25e03f02d5a0d687333d368f8b4ca8080fac0d40c5fe0c71d07990b2bd5b254", "ja": "あら、本当ですね～。\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "哎呀，真的呢～。\n{$P$}先生，辛苦您了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8cac46a493d5b9023167931ec8d3df422559575030b89af75f0e2785b55fba49", "ja": "真美、朋花、お疲れさま。\n前の仕事はもう終わったのか？", "zh": "真美、朋花，辛苦了。之前的工作已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "24ca3750e1c1871ab8d01008b7efede4de125c70ae5240a798c03a45a79d72ed", "ja": "ええ。これから真美ちゃんと、\n控え室に向かうところでしたよ～。", "zh": "嗯。我们正准备和真美一起去休息室～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "64140a26a6c68df508c05b9b443bf1f21973e2be51016b67cf617af6d3bcbcfe", "ja": "兄ちゃんも一緒に行くでしょ？\nそれじゃ、みんなでレッツゴー！", "zh": "哥哥也一起去吧？\n那么，大家一起出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "f370b04bb21c3354656e49811104eb8e89b4ad54d3df8bcd43531d737f919c7f", "ja": "はろはろ～！\nお、3人とも、すでにお揃いですなぁ。", "zh": "你好你好～！\n哎呀，3人都已经到齐了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1a6a892491249d6e3d9623d3d6e4e3de17c869c62faf86765a580ff05d189d93", "ja": "あ、真美、朋花！\n{$P$}も、お疲れ！", "zh": "啊，真美、朋花！\n{$P$}也辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c2944ad00a0968826ec6643003f76e473786d191722f559c641b910305482f84", "ja": "お疲れさま、歩。\n全員揃ってるみたいだし、早速始めようか！", "zh": "辛苦了，步。\n大家好像都到齐了，那就马上开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "3412823c705906c031b0acc8b09e82dba69086a56ff5af0a96fa58253054106f", "ja": "この5人が、次の定期公演のメンバーでしたね～。\n目玉は、歩さんの新曲お披露目ですな～。", "zh": "这5人，就是下次定期公演的成员了呢～  \n亮点是步的新歌首次公开演出哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "44b0002161405db20a774e68c7e4744459c0d78c769d9256e8a14d928a2aaa55", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　{$P$}に\n聞かせてもらったんだけど、すごいクールな曲でさ♪", "zh": "就是这样！{$P$}让我听过了，是首特别酷的歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d2758807db31f21eb1cb411e5bf2464212adb6033fc85626fffd81cb7e5e1aa", "ja": "まあ、今のアタシなら楽勝！\n……とまでは、流石に行かないんだけど……。", "zh": "嘛，以现在的我来说，轻轻松松！\n……倒还没到这种程度就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d0aa9e6088ca745adabfb90b5e4142c578a557108a7e9057880f941999a31bb1", "ja": "でも、歌への苦手意識を克服するチャンスだし！\nアタシなりに、精いっぱいがんばろうと思ってる！", "zh": "不过，这可是克服对唱歌的畏惧感的机会！\n所以，我也打算用自己的方式竭尽全力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "1a9322f032710d17eecc375f9b915a37f1c749b5efabcda6fbb4be1ee9221cb0", "ja": "あら……？　歩さん、歌が苦手だったんですか～？", "zh": "哎呀……？步小姐，原来你不擅长唱歌吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "d84c91d5f623e3f51368411d52a0fc7abcf16b10e288718456117c1e0f2550e6", "ja": "そうなんだって。意外だよね。", "zh": "听说是这样的。很意外吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "644fd4594d6b460d99d63ab0708fbb94f3155dc97fd11917e72193284dc7f738", "ja": "いや……みんなと歌ってる時は、\n置いていかれないように必死なんだけど。", "zh": "不是……和大家一起唱歌的时候，我总是拼命努力，生怕被落下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a589e95492a5955294a045fe30bace052ecbe9dc66b8cb1248d413805fcbdadd", "ja": "ソロになると、緊張して\nガチガチになっちゃうんだよね……あはは。", "zh": "一到独唱，就会紧张得整个人僵住……啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "b0b7a7cc5b992520d2e3949bae968ae8e4ce01dfe78ecb630ca3543e4f3e0980", "ja": "あゆあゆ、意外と真面目だもんね。", "zh": "步步，没想到你还挺认真的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bfef32fbf42a68b74b54835c90820d1390edea971a9261a6bf45fba9ea6605bb", "ja": "もう、意外とは余計だよ！", "zh": "真是的，“意外”是多余的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1020_p", "source_sha256": "66ddc19177494aea9e07c5a744db3ba9acc9c8259c0f1274d94d8e3903cea59f", "ja": "みんな、よろしくな。レッスンは来週からだから、\n各自スケジュールを確認しておいてくれ！", "zh": "大家，请多指教了。课程从下周开始，\n各位请确认好自己的日程安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1023_043nor", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "36ee335c8f323b3ce8480641b6e4648a247558c78f23bc5a60e69defac2b421c", "ja": "次の公演、楽しみだな～。最近歌も調子いいし、\nこれなら間違いなし！　……なんて♪", "zh": "好期待下一场演出啊～最近唱歌状态也很好，\n这样肯定没问题！……之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc82dfb1e624e686f27658dea108b40260d51ac7293ed1a798f0b5f59c63a0b5", "ja": "そうだ！　久しぶりに、洋服見て帰ろうかな！？\n最近忙しくて、あんまり行けてなかったんだよね～。", "zh": "对了！难得出来一趟，要不要顺便去看看衣服再回去呢！？\n最近太忙了，都没怎么去逛呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f336c4cedb7c68e424830dd38fafc0745660746fe46ed86cd9cefebb2b3548ce", "ja": "あっ、この服すっごくカワイイじゃん！\n値段は……あ……、普段着にはちょっと高いかなぁ。", "zh": "啊，这件衣服也太可爱了吧！\n价格是……啊……作为日常穿的话，稍微有点贵吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "58ab0bc1e42c0093ca3fde9241ed70cd67990c65bf8c619bcc4f2762c01271a5", "ja": "けど、新曲のお披露目も決まったし！\nここは、レッスンに気合いを入れるためにも……！", "zh": "不过，新歌的首次亮相也定下来了！\n为了给练习鼓足干劲……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "82d0bb6a3055d92afd26c6a833802e1f0297250983af67f66dc27007341b1c93", "ja": "あれ、電話だ？\n誰からだろ……って、兄貴！？", "zh": "咦，来电话了？\n是谁打来的啊……等等，老哥！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15cd7b2f1c66da45915a699f291bd501b8af26459ee16e071dd7609269336eb8", "ja": "も、もしもし、兄貴？　久しぶりじゃん！\nどう？　ニューヨークは。天気いい？", "zh": "喂、喂，哥？好久不见啦！\n纽约那边怎么样？天气好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1035_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "6785e099dcdcaff230fe1065ebe07e61a410b69f3d16ee00fdbac90b774e2fe0", "ja": "「久しぶりだな、歩！\n天気も何も、こっちは今、夜中だけど」", "zh": "「好久不见啦，步！\n什么天气不天气的，我这边现在可是大半夜啊」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a8cf6792c2f6899bdcfba34b4112d28b5e4f30ca0bdafbd15e3a1b7644bf2da2", "ja": "あ～っ！　そ、そっか、忘れてたよ！\nアハ、アハハハ……。", "zh": "啊～！对、对哦，我都忘了！\n啊哈，啊哈哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1037_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "e2e5040519da368bfe0cb1e89169c555b1ec63868ae959dfe8e98b4d2d0dfa48", "ja": "「歩……お前、何かあっただろ」", "zh": "“步……你身上，是发生什么事了吧”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "42eaf1af0bfb7fbba89675f9063841a2edcae49fd080ade7457aebd6c6a99528", "ja": "え、ええっ！？\n……なんでわかったんだろ？", "zh": "诶、诶诶！？\n……为什么会被发现呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "309998d38c9c0cf3d3b33c0df35dfd1439de647a631d650491503def7a7c4e4d", "ja": "や～、その、大したコトじゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "呀～，那个，也不是什么大不了的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c5168b0e8e1d1cbe58c653337a78b9124ff3bfd74765e0f1a1e5b36946c7d393", "ja": "実は、新しいソロ曲をもらってさ！\n今度劇場で、お披露目公演があるんだ。", "zh": "其实我拿到了一首新的个人单曲！\n下次在剧场会有披露公演哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1041_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "9b5d467677ba797d11af87b73825c0df1fd495c7440473a9500fdd10ec7b547d", "ja": "「へえ、すごいじゃないか！\nもうすぐなのか？」", "zh": "「哦，真厉害啊！\n马上就要到了吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9350a6cda339a0fabb4f1871b7ac682064078a5cf3724abc006ba83bd98c99af", "ja": "うん！　2週間後だよ。", "zh": "嗯！再过2周哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1043_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "d8f7d7c8b0e542a2c28784b0ec45e8e34e79cb354ff00f5797264753b5e77a19", "ja": "「ちょうど良かった。実は来週から暫くの間、\n仕事で日本にいるんだよ」", "zh": "正好。其实从下周开始，我会因为工作在日本待一段时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_093_1045_ayumunoani", "source_sha256": "92fdff15f475d1c03b8f4dad285bd5ff7c556430d1665ac073cd315c010f3ae2", "ja": "「観に行くから、俺の分、1枚取っておいてくれ。\nじゃあな！」", "zh": "“我会去看的，记得帮我留1张票啊。\n回见啦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
